{
  "id": "merge-test",
  "name": "Merge verify + debug-fix focus test",
  "trigger": {
    "source": "card_completed",
    "condition": {
      "assignee": "tech-lead",
      "status": "done",
      "title_prefix_any": [
        "[merge-test]"
      ]
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "close",
      "profile": "tech-lead",
      "skill": "loops-engineering",
      "body_template": "## Close — merge ticket branch into master\n\n**Ticket:** ${trigger.title}\n**Repo:** ${trigger.card_body}\n\n### Step 1: Merge\n\n```bash\ncd ${trigger.card_body}\ngit checkout master\ngit merge --no-ff ticket-focus\n```\n\n### Step 2: Run tests\n\n```bash\npytest -q\n```\n\n- If ANY test fails: do NOT fix it. Complete with verdict=test_failure and record failing test names in failing_tests.\n- If ALL tests pass: proceed.\n\n### Step 3: Verify no lost work\n\n```bash\ngit log master..ticket-focus\n```\n\nShould output nothing.\n\n**Completion metadata:**\n{verdict: \"merged\"|\"test_failure\"|\"escalated\", merged_to: \"master\", all_tests_pass: true|false, task_count: 2, failing_tests: \"\"}",
      "title_template": "[close] ${trigger.title}",
      "output": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "verdict"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "merged",
                "test_failure",
                "escalated"
              ]
            },
            "merged_to": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "all_tests_pass": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "task_count": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "failing_tests": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "merge-verify",
      "profile": "verifier",
      "skill": "adversarial-review",
      "body_template": "## Merge verification\n\n**Repo:** ${trigger.card_body}\n\nProve the merge is real:\n1. git log master..ticket-focus (must be empty)\n2. git fsck --unreachable (no ticket/fix commits)\n3. pytest -q (all pass)\n4. git worktree list / git stash list (no stray work)\n\n**Completion metadata:**\n{verdict: \"PASS\"|\"FAIL\", branch_merged: true|false, no_dangling: true|false, tests_pass: true|false, all_tests: N, findings: []}",
      "title_template": "[merge-verify] ${trigger.title}",
      "output": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "verdict"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PASS",
                "FAIL"
              ]
            },
            "branch_merged": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "no_dangling": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "tests_pass": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "all_tests": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "findings": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "depends_on": [
        "close"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debug-fix",
      "profile": "debugger",
      "skill": "debug-loop",
      "type": "subworkflow",
      "workflow_ref": "debug-fix",
      "body_template": "noop",
      "title_template": "[debug-fix] ${trigger.title}",
      "input_mapping": {
        "repo": "${trigger.card_body}",
        "failing_tests": "${nodes.close.output.failing_tests}",
        "context": "${trigger.title}",
        "bug_title": "${trigger.title}"
      },
      "output_mapping": {
        "verdict": "${nodes.verify-fix.output.verdict}",
        "fix_commit": "${nodes.debug.output.fix_commit}",
        "root_cause": "${nodes.debug.output.root_cause_summary}"
      },
      "output": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "verdict"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PASS",
                "FAIL"
              ]
            },
            "fix_commit": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "root_cause": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "depends_on": [
        "close"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "re-merge",
      "profile": "tech-lead",
      "skill": "loops-engineering",
      "body_template": "## Re-merge after debug fix\n\n**Repo:** ${trigger.card_body}\n**Debug verdict:** ${nodes.debug-fix.output.verdict}\n\n```bash\ncd ${trigger.card_body}\npytest -q\n```\n\n- ALL pass: verdict=merged\n- ANY fail: verdict=escalated\n\n**Completion metadata:**\n{verdict: \"merged\"|\"escalated\", all_tests_pass: true|false, debug_fixed: true}",
      "title_template": "[re-merge] ${trigger.title}",
      "output": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "verdict"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "merged",
                "escalated"
              ]
            },
            "all_tests_pass": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "debug_fixed": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "depends_on": [
        "debug-fix"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "close",
      "to": "merge-verify",
      "condition": "${nodes.close.output.verdict} == 'merged'"
    },
    {
      "from": "close",
      "to": "debug-fix",
      "condition": "${nodes.close.output.verdict} == 'test_failure'"
    },
    {
      "from": "debug-fix",
      "to": "re-merge"
    }
  ]
}